OL,3,GNEWSASimply Red to headline new event
OL,4,Aat cricket ground
OL,5,
OL,6,FPop and soul band Simply Red has been
OL,7,Fbooked to headline a summer festival at
OL,8,Fa cricket ground in Taunton next year.
OL,10,FThe recently announced Somerset Sounds
OL,11,Fevent will take place on 22 August 2027
OL,12,Fat the Somerset County Cricket Ground
OL,13,Fin the town.
OL,15,FOrganisers said they hoped the event
OL,16,Fwould put Somerset on the map as a
OL,17,Fdestination for big music acts.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
