OL,3,GNEWSASimply Red to headline new event
OL,4,Aat cricket ground
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They are such a fantastic band, it's a
OL,7,Freal accolade," said Caroline Herbert,
OL,8,Fcommercial director at Somerset Cricket
OL,9,FGround. "It is the start of something
OL,10,Fmuch bigger for the county ground, to
OL,11,Fmake Somerset a destination for live
OL,12,Fmusic."
